Subject: [PATCH 08/31] BlueOS: SystemUI: Halo lock screen clock

A clock face next to the default one (Wallpaper and style > Clock): Outfit digits, semi-bold on the lock screen and thin on AOD, minutes in the accent color and a halo over the hours. Font family blueos-clock from vendor/blueos/tools/make-fonts.py.

